<import src="../../templates/state.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE FAMILY</view><view class="title">我的毛孩子</view><view class="subtitle">各有各的可爱，每一只都值得偏爱。</view><view class="section"><text class="section-title">宠物档案 · {{total}}</text><text class="link" bindtap="add">＋ 添加宠物</text></view><template is="state" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="card row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image class="avatar" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.typeText}} · {{item.genderText}}</view><text class="tag">{{item.breed || '独一无二'}}</text></view><text>›</text></view><view wx:if="{{!list.length && !loading}}" class="empty"><image src="/images/pet.png"/>{{guest ? '登录后，为毛孩子建立自己的档案。' : '这里还没有宠物，先认识一下它吧。'}}<button class="primary" bindtap="add">{{guest ? '微信登录' : '添加宠物'}}</button></view></view>
